{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite deck-building RPG where your choices shape both the fate of the village and your legacy as a hero. <br>The medieval village of Millford is harassed nightly by the evils lurking within the nearby cursed woods. Creatures grow bolder, the roads grow more dangerous, and the villagers look to you for salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, complete perilous quests, and master strategic card combat to banish the horrors of the forest. Restore safety to the village and becoming the Hero of Millford.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE DECK</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Begin your journey with basic combat abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your energy wisely to draw cards and execute powerful plays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new cards as you progress to shape your deck and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique strategies through class-specific cards and equipment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343630/extras/7b8ca4bbb6b3a28a33022d2eeb935f71.avif?t=1768882204\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343630/extras_big/7b8ca4bbb6b3a28a33022d2eeb935f71.avif?t=1768882204 width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRATEGIC COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your actions carefully - every card and move matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your tactics as enemies grow stronger and more dangerous</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the balance between offense, defense, and special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit status effects, clever combos, and precise timing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRAVE THE CURSED WOODS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through a progressively challenging bestiary of creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From vicious rats and giant spiders to fearsome bears and giant snakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the inhabitents of Millford and uncover the mystery behind the forest's corruption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory brings Millford one step closer to safety</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343630/extras/28e48ef237ee4a9cb80e2ead16b77955.avif?t=1768882204\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343630/extras_big/28e48ef237ee4a9cb80e2ead16b77955.avif?t=1768882204 width=800 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISE TO GLORY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold and rewards for every foe defeated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear, weapons, and consumables at the village shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Fame to unlock powerful long-term progression across playthroughs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the legendary hero Millford desperately needs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343630/extras/434158bcaac6f36760d82ed2b8d5c61b.avif?t=1768882204\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343630/extras_big/434158bcaac6f36760d82ed2b8d5c61b.avif?t=1768882204 width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master your deck, complete dangerous quests, and rise through fame to become the <strong>Card Hero of Millford</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village\u2019s fate \u2014 and your legend \u2014 rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck-building card games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval fantasy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Defeat Giant Spider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343630/d63e9c0b8c7fd6f7eaa3b3fb55a8d6b2ad12e040.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Giant Rat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343630/89c8e4d64ee1d72f65accc15f824b08b0e16e51e.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Vampire Bat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343630/d8e719df80a8561978404481ff78d950127a72cd.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Wild Boar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343630/e1742e7879f9d8db2320b58a938b1b8b12a09b8b.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343630/d6aeabdcf05328f9d8b7f0a662a5a7751998e658.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Goldsnatcher Goblin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343630/0e29042b029d24767bf1a20533e3b20668e5044d.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Giant Snake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343630/7032f8793cf062559b44e69cbc393926bad268d9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Orc Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3343630/4a9f28c9e532fe183d8406307ef1c752533e13d1.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Raging Bear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com